{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06555","headline":"同王十三维偶然作十首 二 · 储光羲","name":"同王十三维偶然作十首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北山种松柏，南山种蒺藜。\n出入虽同趣，所向各有宜。\n孔丘贵仁义，老氏好无爲。\n我心若虚空，此道将安施。\n暂过伊阙间，晼晚三伏时。\n高阁入云中，芙蓉满清池。\n要自非我室，还望南山陲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储光羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06555.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06555","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}